Adds the three workflow files that drive D2/D3/D4 of the explicit Linear
closer (docs/swarm/2026-08-11-linear-github-integration-proposal.md §6, §8):

- linear-sync.yml: on PR merge to main, runs scripts/linear-sync.mjs
  (lane B) in shadow mode (SYNC_MODE hardcoded to shadow), with the
  queue: max concurrency block and the workflow_dispatch pr_number ->
  PR_NUMBER replay seam.
- linear-declaration-gate.yml: PR-time gate running
  scripts/linear-declaration-check.mjs (lane C), with no if: anywhere on
  the job or any step, so a required check can never silently skip.
- linear-reconcile.yml: daily read-only sweep running
  scripts/linear-reconcile.mjs (lane C), reporting drift without writing.

Per GAM-325-packet.md §5's opening subsection, this commit is not pushed:
.github/workflows/** is refused by both credentials a dispatched run
holds (AGENTS.md § "Two walls a dispatched run hits", wall 1). It is
preserved as a git format-patch for the owner to apply.

