Section 5's "First step is the measure step" was literal, and it was
not: the previous commit ran Checkout and Setup Node.js before it. The
measure step needs neither — it is pure shell plus GitHub Actions
context expressions — so move it ahead of both. Also wires GITHUB_TOKEN
into the measure step's env so has_gh_token reflects a real read
instead of an unset variable.

